# Installation packages

After each update to the desktop app or the backend, rebuild the affected installation package before finishing. Do this even when the user does not repeat the request.

- Desktop app (Display Mode, Control Mode, connection, UI): from `app/`, run `CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false npm run build` and then `CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false npx electron-builder --mac dmg zip --arm64 --x64 --win nsis --x64 --publish never`. Do not bake `VITE_API_BASE`. Packages land in `app/release/`.
- Backend (API, CMS, database, discovery): rebuild the DND Server package in `server-app/` the same way. Packages land in `server-app/release/`.
- Rebuild only the package whose code changed.
- Leave packages unsigned (`CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false`).
- Do not install over `/Applications` unless the user asks.
